WEBVTT

00:01:28.738 --> 00:01:30.756
Por kishte probleme.

00:01:30.756 --> 00:01:32.473
Nje problem

00:01:32.473 --> 00:01:35.106
ishte fakti se disa tinguj ne arabisht

00:01:35.106 --> 00:01:38.105
nuk eshte e mundur ti shqiptosh nëpërmjet një zëri Evropian

00:01:38.105 --> 00:01:40.372
pa shume mund e praktike.

00:01:40.372 --> 00:01:42.106
Me besoni kur e them kete.

00:01:42.106 --> 00:01:44.323
Gjithashtu, keto tinguj

00:01:44.323 --> 00:01:46.237
priren te mos jene te perfaqesuara

00:01:46.237 --> 00:01:49.825
nga shkronjat e perdorura ne gjuhet Evropiane.

00:01:49.825 --> 00:01:51.639
Ketu esht nje prej fajtoreve.

00:01:51.639 --> 00:01:53.523
Kjo eshte shkronja SHeen,

00:01:53.523 --> 00:01:57.122
e cila tingellon si SH-- ''sh'.'

00:01:57.122 --> 00:01:59.724
Kjo eshte gjithashtu shkronja me te cilen fillon

00:01:59.724 --> 00:02:02.156
fjala shalan,